		<note type="note" id="e02055">
			<ul id="e02056">
				<li>
					<p>Operating the blower fan when the vehicle is in <?oxy_comment_start author="june" timestamp="20250827T141504+0900" comment="EV 시동체계 변경 차종

POWER ON"?><term translate="no">ACC</term><?oxy_comment_end?> position may cause the 12V battery to discharge. Only operate the blower fan when the vehicle is running.</p>
				</li>
				<li><?oxy_comment_start author="june" timestamp="20250901T140438+0900" comment="2/3열 독립식 공조 ONLY"?>
					<p>The rear seat wind direction and wind volume can be adjusted independently from the front seat. However, the rear seat temperature setting is linked to the front seat controls and may vary depending on usage conditions and the surrounding environment. For faster cabin heating, it is recommended to activate the front and rear air conditioning systems simultaneously.</p><?oxy_comment_end?>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</note>
